- The FORM-CONTROL SPECIAL FORMS (`:default-value`, `:default-checked`, textarea `:value`, select `:value`) are OUT of scope and filed as rf2-slr59. After this change they print as `defaultValue`/`defaultChecked`, which is as inert as today's kebab spelling, so there is no regression.
