THE ARTEFACT (a CLAIM; stage 1 re-derives it): implementation/event-conformance is a test-only artefact with no src. Its deps.edn says the suites exercise the public event model against core's public facade and runtime seams: one-form event registration, recordable coeffects, image-scoped dispatch, reply delivery, and the always-on event/error channels. The mayor's regex census at trunk 47ecce1418 reads 43 deftests in 3 .cljc files (the epic's census said 44):
- event_model_conformance_cljs_test 38;
- event_frame_isolation_conformance_cljs_test 3;
- event_reply_envelope_conformance_cljs_test 2.

